<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>{{ title }}</mj-title>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF">
    <mj-wrapper css-class="container" padding="0">
      <mj-section css-class="logo-sec">
        <mj-column width="190px" padding="0" css-class="no-padding logo-column">
          <mj-image
            src="{{ @asset AmaizingLogo3DHeader }}"
            alt="Amaizing Advantage Beta"
            align="left"
            css-class="mobile-logo"
            padding="0"
          />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Hi
          <strong style="text-transform: capitalize">{{ first_name }}, </strong>
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          We’re on it – your <strong>Market Map</strong> is being built. As soon
          as it’s ready, we’ll let you know.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text> Here’s what to expect next: </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Your <strong>Market Map:</strong> roughly 200 potential competitors
          scanned, the rivals actually competing for your customers identified,
          the search terms they’re competing on surfaced. You’ll confirm both –
          the right rivals, the right terms. Get this right and every report
          that follows reflects your actual market
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          You asked a specific question to be answered – your
          <strong>Market Map</strong> will lead with exactly that.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Then weekly <strong>Market Moves</strong> – what customers are showing
          you, and the competitor moves that matter.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          This works both ways: we deliver intelligence, you engage with it –
          correcting, questioning, directing. The more you interact, the sharper
          it gets. That sharpening is yours.</mj-text
        >
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          No urgency, no commitment. The trial is free and progresses through
          engagement, not a calendar deadline – <strong>Market Map</strong>,
          weekly <strong>Market Moves</strong>, and
          <strong>Deep Dives</strong> on request. After the trial, the
          subscription is $60/month per Hero ASIN.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text> Thanks, </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          The
          <strong
            >Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline">ai</span
            >zing</strong
          >
          Team
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <mj-wrapper css-class="ai footer-wrapper ${this.getAttribute('classes')}">
        <para>
          <mj-text font-size="12px" font-font-weight="300" color="#344054"
            >&#xA9; 2025 Amaizing, Inc., 8 The Green Suite B, Dover, DE 19901,
            USA</mj-text
          >
        </para>
        <mj-section>
          <mj-column padding="0">
            <mj-image
              padding="0"
              css-class="footer-logo"
              width="32px"
              height="28px"
              src="{{ @asset AmaizingIcon3DFooter }}"
              alt="Logomark"
            />
          </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
      </mj-wrapper>
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
